<title>NETHERLANDS: Volker St tax burden remained low in 96.</title>
<headline>Volker St tax burden remained low in 96.</headline>
<dateline>ROTTERDAM 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Construction firm Volker Stevin NV said on Friday its effective tax rate remained low in 1996 at about nine percent of its profits, compared with about 10 percent in 1995.</p>
<p>It said the low effective tax rate was largely due to past losses which it was able to offset against profits before Dutch corporation tax was deducted.  </p>
<p>&quot;This low tax burden mainly reflects Dutch tax-loss carry-forwards which amounted to some 200 million guilders at end-1996,&quot; the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
